  <diagram id="6nLvALutQWDkbE0QUa8I" name="2 - Sequence">
    <mxGraphModel dx="4292" dy="2379" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#10;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n autonumber\n actor W as Waiter\n actor C as Chef\n participant UI as React UI\n participant O as API Controllers / Orders\n participant R as Catalog / Recipes\n participant I as Inventory / Reservations\n participant DB as PostgreSQL\n Note over O,DB: Protected requests: validate JWT, role and input before business operations\n W-&gt;&gt;UI: Submit order\n UI-&gt;&gt;O: POST /v1/orders + Idempotency-Key\n O-&gt;&gt;DB: Atomically claim scoped key and compare request hash\n alt Same key and same body - completed request\n DB--&gt;&gt;O: Original response\n O--&gt;&gt;UI: Replay original response; Idempotent-Replayed: true\n else Same key with a different body\n O--&gt;&gt;UI: 422 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED\n else New request\n rect rgb(225,240,250)\n Note over O,DB: Transaction A - all-or-nothing creation and reservation\n O-&gt;&gt;R: Get current recipe versions and requirements\n R-&gt;&gt;DB: Read recipe snapshot and active flags\n DB--&gt;&gt;R: Versioned quantities; menu item and ingredient active flags\n R--&gt;&gt;O: Requirements, recipeVersion and availability\n break Menu item archived or inactive, or its recipe uses an inactive ingredient\n O-&gt;&gt;DB: ROLLBACK; nothing reserved\n O--&gt;&gt;UI: 422 MENU_ITEM_UNAVAILABLE\n end\n O-&gt;&gt;I: Reserve ingredients in shared transaction\n I-&gt;&gt;DB: Lock inventory rows in stable order; check available\n alt Any ingredient is insufficient\n DB--&gt;&gt;I: Shortage details\n I--&gt;&gt;O: Reservation rejected\n O-&gt;&gt;DB: ROLLBACK all transaction changes\n O--&gt;&gt;UI: 409 INSUFFICIENT_STOCK\n else All ingredients are available\n O-&gt;&gt;DB: Save PENDING order and recipeVersion\n I-&gt;&gt;DB: Save ACTIVE reservations; increase reserved\n Note over I,DB: onHand unchanged; available = onHand - reserved\n O-&gt;&gt;DB: Persist original response and COMMIT shared transaction\n O--&gt;&gt;UI: 201 Created\n end\n end\n end\n Note over C,DB: Later, for a successfully created PENDING order\n C-&gt;&gt;UI: Start preparation\n UI-&gt;&gt;O: PATCH /v1/orders/{orderId}/status: PREPARING\n rect rgb(230,247,235)\n Note over O,DB: Transaction B - state validation and exactly-once consumption\n O-&gt;&gt;DB: BEGIN; lock order and check current status\n alt Current status is PENDING\n O-&gt;&gt;I: Consume ACTIVE reservations in shared transaction\n I-&gt;&gt;DB: Lock stock rows; mark reservations CONSUMED\n I-&gt;&gt;DB: Decrease onHand and reserved by equal quantities\n O-&gt;&gt;DB: Set PREPARING; save status history; COMMIT\n O--&gt;&gt;UI: 200 OK\n else Invalid or repeated PREPARING transition\n O-&gt;&gt;DB: ROLLBACK; no stock change\n O--&gt;&gt;UI: 409 INVALID_STATUS_TRANSITION\n end\n end\n Note over O,DB: Optional status Idempotency-Key: matching replay returns original response without repeating effects&quot;,&#10;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#10;}" id="4AXxVWiKXwv6uhE39dgT-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="4AXxVWiKXwv6uhE39dgT-2" parent="4AXxVWiKXwv6uhE39dgT-1" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#e1f0fa;fillOpacity=100;pointerEvents=0;fontColor=#28253D;fontFamily=Recursive;fontSize=16;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DRecursive;" value="" vertex="1">
