gredient ..&gt; Unit : unit\n note for InventoryItem \&quot;available is derived: onHand - reserved\nonHand &gt;= reserved &gt;= 0\&quot;\n note for OrderItem \&quot;Recipe reference: menuItemId + recipeVersion\nSnapshot remains unchanged after creation\&quot;\n note for Reservation \&quot;Retained history: ACTIVE / CONSUMED / RELEASED\nresolvedAt is optional while ACTIVE\&quot;\n note for Recipe \&quot;Conceptual domain model aligned with OpenAPI\nDetailed database schema is a separate deliverable\&quot;&quot;,&#10;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#10;}" id="rB1BSObfLjhmQYBfNHfA-1">
